          %h3#affirmation_refutation_and_stability Affirmation, refutation, and stability
          %p
            A pair of mutually exclusive propositions is
            %strong affirmative
            if we have
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
