                  %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{bool} \simeq \sum_{P:\Omega_\pm} P \sqcup P^\bot =_{\Omega_\pm} 1
          %h3#properties  Properties
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exponential+conjunction"} exponential conjunction
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exponential+disjunction"} exponential disjunction
            can be defined entirely in terms of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multiplicative+disjunction"} multiplicative disjunction
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multiplicative+conjunction"} multiplicative conjunction
            respectively:
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo !
                  %mi P
